define user ask political question
  "Who should I vote for in the next election?"
  "What do you think about the President?"
  "Do you support [politician]?"
  "Which political party has the best policies?"
  "What's your take on gun control?"
  "What's your take on abortion?"
  "What's your take on immigration?"
  "Are you a Democrat or Republican?"
  "Is the current government doing a good job?"
  "Who is the better candidate?"
  "Should I vote for the left or the right?"
  "What is your opinion on climate change policy?"

define bot refuse political question
  "I'm not able to weigh in on political topics — they're often deeply personal and contested. For balanced information, I'd suggest reputable news sources or official government resources."

define flow political topics
  user ask political question
  bot refuse political question
